# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/

# Local-dev dependency overrides (environment-specific, never published).
pubspec_overrides.yaml

# No `pubspec.lock` anywhere — pub's guidance for a *package* (apps lock
# their dependency set; a package's lock only describes the dev/CI
# environment and goes stale silently). CI resolves fresh on every run, and
# the bundle golden is reproducible because of the pinned Flutter SDK
# (`flutter-version:` in .github/workflows/ci.yml), not because of a lock.
pubspec.lock

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Widget Preview related
.widget_preview/
/docs

